# Direct start into a practice session (#64), also the trace bed for verve.skip (#65).
# Use with tools/sandbox_run.ps1 -Session "grand_prix f1_2025 <track> team=forceindia driver=stroll session=practice1"
# The game's labels are old team names: Aston Martin is forceindia, Alpine is renault, RB is tororosso.
@waitlog the player drives for forceindia as lance_stroll 300
@waitlog \[direct\] screen (garage_cockpit|garage_monitor_container) opened 400
status
@sleep 15
status
